1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Se årboka Ætt og Heim 2001 side 125.
2 CONT
2 CONT HIs son :
2 CONT
2 CONT LARS LARSSON OPSAL (son of LARS (LAURITS)LARSSON OPSAL and MARITA JONSDOTTER TØTLAND) was born 1632 in VIKEDAL, ROGALAND, and died 1715 in BARKELAND, JELSA, ROGALAND. He married ELI STEINSDOTTER, daughter of STEIN (SIVERTSEN) JELS
2 CONC A and BIRGIT ANDERSDOTTER.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of LARS LARSSON OPSAL and ELI STEINSDOTTER are: 
