1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=157042434 Find A Grave]: '''Martha Bryne Bolme'''. Birth: Dec. 14, 1892 in Kathryn, Barnes County, North Dakota, USA. Death: Apr. 28, 1991 in Stutsman County, Nor
2 CONC th Dakota, USA. Burial: Highland Home Cemetery, Jamestown, Stutsman County, North Dakota, USA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Obituary:<br/>
2 CONT '''Martha Bryne Bolme''', second youngest daughter to Gabriel & Ane Bryne was born December 14, 1892 in Kathryn, North Dakota.<br/>
2 CONT Martha grew up and was educated in the Kathryn schools.<br/>
2 CONT She married Nels Bolme on August 14, 1917. Together they had 4 children: Obert, Muriel, Joyce & Richard. The family moved to Jamestown where they took residence until their passing.<br/>
2 CONT Martha was a volunteer at the State Hospital and also held down a job as a waitress at the Igloo Cafe and Reed's Gift Shop. She also worked at he Rudolf Hotel in Valley City, North Dakota.<br/>
2 CONT She was also a very active member of the Trinity Lutheran Church, the VFW Auxiliary, the Disabled American Veterans, and the Sons of Norway Organization.<br/>
2 CONT Nels, her beloved husband of 26 years died on Jan. 16, 1943 at the age of 55.<br/>
2 CONT Martha passed away on April 28, 1991 at the age of 99.<br/>
2 CONT Predeceased by her husband Nels, 1 son, Obert in 1981 and 1 daughter, Muriel in 1985, Martha leaves to mourn her passing daughter Joyce Lorraine Koushkouski, of Jamestown, North Dakota and son Richard of Fargo, North Dakota. 26 gr
2 CONC anchildren, 15 great grand children and 4 great great grandchildren.<br/>
2 CONT Funeral service held at 10:00 a.m. on this Friday in Trinity Lutheran Church with Rev. Norm Anderson officiating. Burial in the Highland Home Cemetery.
