2 CONT Kossuth County Advance 10/27/1932
2 CONT Mrs. Augusta Bergeson Dies.
2 CONT Mrs. W.O. Nelson and Ed Bergeson were called to Linn Grove last week by the death of their mother, Mrs. Augusta Bergeson. Mrs. Bergeson lived for many years in the house now occupied by Mr. Hanson, having gone to live with her dau
2 CONC ghter in Linn Grove the last few years. Mrs. Bergeson is survived by another daughter, Mrs. Charles Knutson, Little Falls, Minn., besides the two daughters and son. She was buried in Linn Grove last week Wednesday.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Spencer News Herald
2 CONT Friday, October 21, 1932, Spencer, Iowa
2 CONT Augusta Bergeson
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral services were held Wednesday afternoon from the Baptist Church in Linn.
2 CONT
2 CONT Augusta Bergeson died at the home of her daughter Rachel in Linn Grove early Monday October following but a few days sickness.
