2 CONT
2 CONT "Osten Assersen Vagle was christened at Stavanger, Norway 19 May 1805. His parents were Asser Ostensen Vagle and Serine Olsen, Sille.
2 CONT He married Martha Helene Hendriksen Forland 4 Aug 1840 . Martha Helene Hendriksen Forland was born at Stavanger, Norway 22 May 1816 daughter of Hendrik Pedersen Forland and Ane Catharine Hagevig .
2 CONT
2 CONT They were the parents of 1 child:
2 CONT Marcelius Ostensen Wagle born 23 Apr 1853.  Osten Assersen Vagle died 25 Nov 1873 at Stavanger, Norway .
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha Helene Hendriksen Forland died at Stavanger, Norway ."
