2 CONT
2 CONT Bertha Maria Lende Mauland 1870–1959
2 CONT
2 CONT Ola Lende 1876–1893
2 CONT
2 CONT Grete Marie Gabrielsdatter married Ole Olsen Lende on Nov. 13, 1859. On Jun. 20, 1860 their first child, Anne Marie, was born. Family in the Norwegian 1875 census: Ole Ols. 1833 Thime, Ly Prgj.  Grete Maria Gabrielsd. 1837 Klep  .
