2 DATE 25 DEC 1870
2 PLAC Kroklid
2 ADDR
3 STAE Nordland
3 CTRY Norway
1 BAPM
2 DATE 29 MAY 1871
2 ADDR
3 STAE Nordland
3 CTRY Norway
