1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Buried in Oak Mound Cemetery on 25 May 1962.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father was Henry Oppegard. Married Nels on March 27, 1909 in Moorhead, Minn. Children - Grace Irene (married Henry Hokanson in 1933), Jessie, Amy. Was a member of Oak Mound Congregational Church and the Oak Mound Ladies Aid.
2 CONT
2 CONT OBITUARY - Fargo Forum, Wednesday, 23 May 1962
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Nels R. Nelson Rites at Oak Mound
2 CONT
2 CONT The funeral of Mrs. Nels R. (Olga) Nelson, 52 South Terrace, formerly of the Oak Mound community north of Moorhead, will be at 2 Friday in Oak Mound Congregational Church.
2 CONT
2 CONT Rev. Thomas Anderson will officiate and burial will be there. Mrs. Nelson died Monday.
