1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Olson, Vernon L. 95 Sept. 08, 1920 Mar. 16, 2016 It is with sadness, yet pride in his accomplishments, that we report the close of Vern Olson's remarkable earthly life March 16, 2016, at his self-designed and buil
2 CONC t Parkrose home, surrounded by his loving family. Blessed with a sharp, inquisitive mind, physical strength and a loving heart all 95 years, his was a great life. Well done! He is survived by his wife of 68 years, Jeanette; childr
2 CONC en, Scott (Leslie), Roger (Connie), Barbara Parker (Doug) and Mark (Jeanette); and grandchildren, Caitlyn, Riley, Alison and Brian. There will be a celebration of life at 2 p.m. Saturday, April 30, 2016, at his church, Parkrose Un
2 CONC ited Church of Christ, 12505 N.E. Halsey St., Portland."
2 CONT Published by The Oregonian from Apr. 14 to Apr. 17, 2016.
