1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Jeslyn D. WINTERS January 4, 1923 ~ October 28, 2010 Born on a farm in North Dakota during a snow storm. After graduating from high school, she moved to Seattle. Survived and greatly missed by her three children K
2 CONC aren, Susan, and Ron, four grand children, four great grand children, brother Vernon, and extended family & friends. Preceded in death by her parents George & Henrietta Olson and husband Louis Winters. We will always love you.....
